<title>MEXICO: Gissa to pay dividend 0.8315 pesos/shr.</title>
<headline>Gissa to pay dividend 0.8315 pesos/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican industrial company Grupo Industrial Saltillo (Gissa) said Wednesday that from May 9 it will pay a dividend of 0.8315 pesos per share to holders of coupon 29.</p>
<p>The dividend payment was agreed by shareholders at the company's annual meeting, Giussa said in a statement to the Mexican Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
